"<main role=\"main\" aria-label=\"MFAT Joint Regeneration Therapy - Autologous Fat Micro-fragment Treatment\" class=\"min-h-screen bg-white\"><section class=\"relative min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-emerald-900 to-slate-900\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/40\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center text-white py-32\"><div style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><p class=\"text-lg text-emerald-200 mb-4 tracking-wider\">Adipose Tissue Regeneration Program</p><h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-bold mb-6\">MFAT关节再生疗法</h1><p class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl text-emerald-200 mb-4\">Adipose Tissue Regeneration</p><p class=\"text-lg text-gray-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8\">自体脂肪微片段关节再生治疗 · 一采多用 · 长效止痛3-4年</p><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4\"><button class=\"px-8 py-4 bg-emerald-500 text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-emerald-600 transition-colors\">立即咨询</button><button class=\"px-8 py-4 border-2 border-white text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\">了解更多</button></div></div></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-8 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2\" style=\"opacity: 1;\"><div class=\"w-6 h-10 border-2 border-white/50 rounded-full flex justify-center\"><div class=\"w-1.5 h-3 bg-white rounded-full mt-2\" style=\"transform: translateY(0.243778px);\"></div></div></div></section><section id=\"intro\" class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center\"><div style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-30px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-6\">什么是MFAT关节再生疗法？</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-lg mb-6\">自体脂肪微片段（Micro-Fragmented Adipose Tissue，MFAT）技术通过微创方式采集自身的腹部或大腿脂肪，经过无酶物理破碎处理，将其注入关节腔。干细胞分化为软骨细胞修复组织；生长因子抗炎镇痛；细胞外基质则充当天然支架，增强局部修复微环境。</p><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-6\">MFAT的核心价值在于\"一采多用\"——采集的脂肪经-80℃冷冻保存后，两年后解冻的细胞活率（55.73%）与新鲜样本（59.75%）无显著差异，且微生物检测100%无菌。患者仅需接受一次微创抽脂，即可在需要时多次使用同一批MFAT产品，极大降低了重复治疗的痛苦和成本。</p><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-6\">我们将这一现代再生技术与科学的康复方案系统性整合，形成了\"治疗-修复-康复\"三位一体的综合方案。</p><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-4 text-emerald-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle \"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"font-semibold\">自体来源 · 零排异 · 长效止痛3-4年</span></div></div><div class=\"relative\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(30px);\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1576091160550-2173dba999ef?w=800&amp;q=80\" alt=\"MFAT Treatment\" class=\"rounded-2xl shadow-2xl w-full\"></div></div></div></section><section id=\"advantages\" class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-slate-50\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">核心优势</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">六大核心优势，为您的关节健康保驾护航</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield \"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">自体来源，零排异、零风险</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600\">MFAT的原材料取自您自己的脂肪组织，从根源上杜绝了异体组织的免疫排异反应和血源性传染病风险，是再生医学领域中极为安全的自体疗法之一。</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-snowflake \"><line x1=\"2\" x2=\"22\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"2\" y2=\"22\"></line><path d=\"m20 16-4-4 4-4\"></path><path d=\"m4 8 4 4-4 4\"></path><path d=\"m16 4-4 4-4-4\"></path><path d=\"m8 20 4-4 4 4\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">一采多用，冷冻保存打造\"个人组织银行\"</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600\">脂肪采集后，富余的MFAT可在-80℃条件下冷冻保存2年以上。解冻后细胞活率（55.73%）与新鲜样本（59.75%）无显著差异，微生物检测100%无菌。未来需要二次注射时，无需再次抽脂，直接取用冻存MFAT即可。</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock \"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">一次注射，长效止痛（长达3-4年）</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600\">2025年一项335例KOA患者随访研究显示，单次MFAT注射后3个月所有临床评分显著改善（p&lt;0.001），且改善效果持续保持至3年随访终点。另有4年随访研究证实，68%的患者在注射4年后仍保持临床有效性。</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-activity \"><path d=\"M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">超越透明质酸，针对炎症表型OA优势更明显</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600\">研究表明，MFAT在治疗伴有炎症表型的膝骨关节炎方面具有独特的靶向优势，KOOS症状评分改善显著优于透明质酸组。</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-thermometer \"><path d=\"M14 4v10.54a4 4 0 1 1-4 0V4a2 2 0 0 1 4 0Z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">门诊级微创操作，治疗当日离院</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600\">脂肪采集+制备+关节腔精准注射可于门诊一次性完成，全程约1.5-2小时，患者治疗后观察1-2小时即可自主下地离院，无需住院。</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-dollar-sign \"><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"2\" y2=\"22\"></line><path d=\"M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">全球价格竞争力无与伦比</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600\">中国MFAT单次全部费用（含麻醉、微创抽脂、MFAT制备、超声引导关节腔注射）仅为美国同类治疗的1/5-1/10，价差可达5-10倍。</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"indications\" class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">适应症</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">MFAT关节再生治疗主要适用于以下人群</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow border border-gray-100\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1559757175-5700dde675bc?w=600&amp;q=80\" alt=\"早中期膝骨关节炎\" class=\"w-full h-48 object-cover\"><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">早中期膝骨关节炎</h3><p class=\"text-emerald-600 text-sm mb-4\">Kellgren-Lawrence分级Ⅱ-Ⅲ级</p><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-emerald-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>关节疼痛、晨僵、关节肿胀、活动受限</li><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-emerald-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>对口服止痛药、玻璃酸钠或PRP注射效果不佳或不耐受</li><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-emerald-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>希望保留自然关节、推迟或避免人工关节置换</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow border border-gray-100\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1612349317150-e413f6a5b16d?w=600&amp;q=80\" alt=\"伴有炎症特征的膝骨关节炎\" class=\"w-full h-48 object-cover\"><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">伴有炎症特征的膝骨关节炎</h3><p class=\"text-emerald-600 text-sm mb-4\">关节肿胀、弹响、晨僵明显</p><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-emerald-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>关节肿胀明显</li><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-emerald-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>关节弹响</li><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-emerald-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>晨僵时间较长</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow border border-gray-100\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1571019614242-c5c5dee9f50b?w=600&amp;q=80\" alt=\"慢性运动损伤相关性关节病\" class=\"w-full h-48 object-cover\"><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">慢性运动损伤相关性关节病</h3><p class=\"text-emerald-600 text-sm mb-4\">长期运动导致的关节退变</p><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-emerald-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>韧带损伤</li><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-emerald-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>软骨磨损</li><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-emerald-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>运动员关节保护</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow border border-gray-100\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1581056771107-24ca5f4d9b6d?w=600&amp;q=80\" alt=\"术后辅助修复\" class=\"w-full h-48 object-cover\"><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">术后辅助修复</h3><p class=\"text-emerald-600 text-sm mb-4\">关节镜清理术后配合MFAT</p><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-emerald-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>促进术后软骨修复</li><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-emerald-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>减轻术后炎症反应</li><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-emerald-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>加速康复进程</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow border border-gray-100\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1505751172876-fa1923c5c528?w=600&amp;q=80\" alt=\"对西药不耐受或希望减少药物依赖者\" class=\"w-full h-48 object-cover\"><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">对西药不耐受或希望减少药物依赖者</h3><p class=\"text-emerald-600 text-sm mb-4\">希望通过生物疗法综合调理</p><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-emerald-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>止痛药效果减弱或副作用明显</li><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-emerald-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>希望减少药物依赖</li><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-emerald-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>寻求更自然的疗法</li></ul></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"treatment\" class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-slate-50\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">治疗内容</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">两大治疗模块，全方位关节康复方案</p></div><div class=\"space-y-8\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-4 mb-6\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-microscope \"><path d=\"M6 18h8\"></path><path d=\"M3 22h18\"></path><path d=\"M14 22a7 7 0 1 0 0-14h-1\"></path><path d=\"M9 14h2\"></path><path d=\"M9 12a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6h6v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2Z\"></path><path d=\"M12 6V3a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H9a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v3\"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E]\">模块一：自体脂肪微片段核心治疗</h3><p class=\"text-emerald-600\">Micro-Fragmented Adipose Tissue Therapy</p></div></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-4\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-emerald-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-3\">1</div><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">微创脂肪采集</h4><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">局部麻醉下从腹部或大腿抽取少量脂肪（约5-15ml），微创切口＜2mm，约15分钟</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-4\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-emerald-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-3\">2</div><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">MFAT制备</h4><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">物理破碎为200-400微米微片段，不添加外源性酶，剩余MFAT可冷冻保存备用</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-4\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-emerald-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-3\">3</div><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">关节腔精准注射</h4><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">18MHz高频超声引导下精确注入，误差控制在0.5mm以内，约15分钟</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-4\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-emerald-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-3\">4</div><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">门诊观察</h4><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">留观1-2小时，患者可自主下地行走，当日离院</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-4 mb-6\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-heart \"><path d=\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E]\">模块二：功能锻炼与康复指导</h3><p class=\"text-emerald-600\">Rehabilitation &amp; Exercise</p></div></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-4\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">肌力训练</h4><p class=\"text-gray-600\">指导股四头肌等长收缩训练，强化膝关节稳定性</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-4\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">康复运动</h4><p class=\"text-gray-600\">推荐科学的康复运动方案，促进关节长期养护，预防复发</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"process\" class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">治疗流程</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">八步完整流程，专为海外患者设计</p></div><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 relative\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-6\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0\">1</div><div class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-2\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] text-lg\">线上咨询与病历评估</h3><span class=\"text-sm text-emerald-600 bg-emerald-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">2-5个工作日</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600\">提交膝关节X光负重位、MRI（≥1.5T）影像、既往治疗史及关节功能评分（VAS、WOMAC等），医学顾问进行资料审核和初步适应症筛查</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 relative\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-6\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0\">2</div><div class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-2\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] text-lg\">远程MDT会诊</h3><span class=\"text-sm text-emerald-600 bg-emerald-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">3-7个工作日</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600\">骨科+再生医学科医师联合视频会诊，确定个性化治疗方案：MFAT剂量、是否需要冻存、费用预估和治疗行程</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 relative\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-6\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0\">3</div><div class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-2\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] text-lg\">签证与行程安排</h3><span class=\"text-sm text-emerald-600 bg-emerald-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">7-14个工作日</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600\">出具医疗邀请函，指导办理S2/S1医疗签证，协助预订机票、机场接送和医院附近住宿，预约MFAT治疗档期</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 relative\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-6\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0\">4</div><div class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-2\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] text-lg\">入院评估与术前准备</h3><span class=\"text-sm text-emerald-600 bg-emerald-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">抵华后1-2天</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600\">完成必需检查：血常规、凝血功能、传染病筛查、血小板计数、心电图、体重指数评估等，膝关节影像复核</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 relative\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-6\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0\">5</div><div class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-2\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] text-lg\">MFAT治疗实施</h3><span class=\"text-sm text-emerald-600 bg-emerald-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">抵华后第2-3天</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600\">门诊手术室局部麻醉下进行微创脂肪采集（约15分钟）→ MFAT物理制备（约20分钟）→ 超声引导下关节腔精准注射（约15分钟），全程约1.5-2小时</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 relative\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-6\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0\">6</div><div class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-2\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] text-lg\">康复辅助治疗</h3><span class=\"text-sm text-emerald-600 bg-emerald-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">贯穿整个在华期间及返国后</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600\">注射后专业康复师指导进行功能锻炼，配合物理治疗促进恢复，加速关节功能康复</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 relative\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-6\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0\">7</div><div class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-2\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] text-lg\">出院指导与返程</h3><span class=\"text-sm text-emerald-600 bg-emerald-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">治疗结束前</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600\">康复医师制定个性化功能锻炼方案（含居家视频指导），提供英文版康复手册</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 relative\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-6\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0\">8</div><div class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-2\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] text-lg\">远程随访与健康管理</h3><span class=\"text-sm text-emerald-600 bg-emerald-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">治疗后12个月</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600\">提供移动端疼痛评分和关节功能自评系统，远程视频复诊，如冻存MFAT可在必要时安排补充注射</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"efficacy\" class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-slate-900 text-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4\">疗效数据</h2><p class=\"text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">核心循证数据与疗效时间线</p></div><div class=\"overflow-x-auto mb-12\"><table class=\"w-full\"><thead><tr class=\"border-b border-slate-700\"><th class=\"text-left py-4 px-4 text-emerald-400 font-semibold\">指标</th><th class=\"text-left py-4 px-4 text-emerald-400 font-semibold\">研究结果</th><th class=\"text-left py-4 px-4 text-emerald-400 font-semibold\">证据等级</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-4 px-4 text-gray-300 text-sm\">单次MFAT注射3年随访</td><td class=\"py-4 px-4 text-white\">所有评分（VAS、OKS、WOMAC、KOOS）在3个月显著改善（p&lt;0.001），效果持续至3年</td><td class=\"py-4 px-4\"><span class=\"bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">Ⅲ级，335例队列研究</span></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-4 px-4 text-gray-300 text-sm\">4年随访持续有效性</td><td class=\"py-4 px-4 text-white\">68%的患者在注射后4年仍保持临床有效性</td><td class=\"py-4 px-4\"><span class=\"bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">Ⅱ级，46例前瞻性研究</span></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-4 px-4 text-gray-300 text-sm\">vs 透明质酸（炎症表型OA）</td><td class=\"py-4 px-4 text-white\">KOOS症状评分MFAT组+25.0 vs HA组+12.7（p=0.008），僵硬、肿胀、弹响改善更优</td><td class=\"py-4 px-4\"><span class=\"bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">Ⅰ级，53例RCT</span></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-4 px-4 text-gray-300 text-sm\">vs SVF（倾向性评分匹配）</td><td class=\"py-4 px-4 text-white\">MFAT屈曲活动度改善优于SVF（p=0.03），MRI T2映射显示MFAT软骨保存效应更佳且持久性更长</td><td class=\"py-4 px-4\"><span class=\"bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">Ⅲ级，72例队列</span></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-4 px-4 text-gray-300 text-sm\">冷冻MFAT活率数据</td><td class=\"py-4 px-4 text-white\">冻存2年后细胞活率（55.73%）与新鲜样本（59.75%）无显著差异，微生物检测100%无菌</td><td class=\"py-4 px-4\"><span class=\"bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">实验室研究</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"text-center mb-8\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-8\">疗效时间线</h3></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"bg-slate-800 rounded-xl p-4 flex items-start gap-4\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);\"><div class=\"w-32 flex-shrink-0 text-emerald-400 font-semibold\">注射后1-2周</div><div class=\"text-gray-300\">轻度关节肿胀、酸胀感（正常炎性反应），冰敷3-5天自行消退</div></div><div class=\"bg-slate-800 rounded-xl p-4 flex items-start gap-4\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);\"><div class=\"w-32 flex-shrink-0 text-emerald-400 font-semibold\">注射后1-3个月</div><div class=\"text-gray-300\">疼痛明显减轻，晨僵时间缩短，日常上下楼梯更轻松</div></div><div class=\"bg-slate-800 rounded-xl p-4 flex items-start gap-4\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);\"><div class=\"w-32 flex-shrink-0 text-emerald-400 font-semibold\">注射后3-6个月</div><div class=\"text-gray-300\">关节功能显著改善，跛行现象明显减轻，生活质量明显提升</div></div><div class=\"bg-slate-800 rounded-xl p-4 flex items-start gap-4\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);\"><div class=\"w-32 flex-shrink-0 text-emerald-400 font-semibold\">注射后6-12个月</div><div class=\"text-gray-300\">疗效稳定保持，软骨修复在影像学上开始显现</div></div><div class=\"bg-slate-800 rounded-xl p-4 flex items-start gap-4\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);\"><div class=\"w-32 flex-shrink-0 text-emerald-400 font-semibold\">注射后12-36个月</div><div class=\"text-gray-300\">持续改善效应维持，部分患者需补充注射巩固疗效；4年随访仍有68%患者保持有效</div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"cases\" class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-slate-50\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">真实案例</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">患者真实反馈，见证疗效</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1546519638-68e109498ffc?w=600&amp;q=80\" alt=\"美国退休工程师Jim——MFAT让68岁重返高尔夫球场\" class=\"w-full h-48 object-cover\"><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">美国退休工程师Jim——MFAT让68岁重返高尔夫球场</h3><p class=\"text-emerald-600 text-sm mb-4\">跨国医疗的真实见证</p><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Jim（68岁，美国德克萨斯州）被双膝骨关节炎困扰6年，K-L分级Ⅲ级。上下楼梯剧痛，在社区行走300米即需休息止痛。在美国咨询MFAT治疗，报价约4万美元，超出预期。通过医疗旅游中介来到中国，接受了MFAT单膝治疗配合为期2周的康复套餐。结果：治疗后3个月，VAS评分从7分降至2分，可以每周打2次高尔夫球（每次9洞）。Jim表示：\"中国医生教我科学的康复锻炼方法，现在膝盖比以前灵活多了。\"他选择了冻存剩余MFAT备用，一年后计划做另一侧膝盖。</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1576091160399-112ba8d25d1d?w=600&amp;q=80\" alt=\"新加坡Angela女士——7年疼痛，3周中国之行改变一切\" class=\"w-full h-48 object-cover\"><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">新加坡Angela女士——7年疼痛，3周中国之行改变一切</h3><p class=\"text-emerald-600 text-sm mb-4\">从绝望到重获新生</p><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Angela（55岁，新加坡）是一名中学教师，膝关节炎病史7年，K-L分级Ⅱ-Ⅲ级。走路跛行，久站时右膝钻心疼，周末无法陪孩子户外活动。在新加坡尝试过PRP、玻尿酸治疗，效果均短暂。经网上研究，选择来中国接受MFAT治疗。方案：MFAT单次注射+综合康复疗程。结果：治疗后2周疼痛明显减轻，能蹲下系鞋带；治疗后3个月疼痛评分从7分降至1分，步行半小时完全无痛。她现已取消当地关节置换手术的预约，并强烈推荐给身边朋友。</p></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"services\" class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">支持服务</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">我们为每一位来华接受MFAT治疗的海外患者提供从行前到返程的全链路服务</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-globe \"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h20\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">签证指导与办理</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">医疗邀请函、S2/S1签证材料辅导、入境登记协助</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin \"><path d=\"M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0 1 16 0Z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">落地接待与交通</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">专车接机、酒店及康养公寓预订、生活指导</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users \"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">语言支持与医疗翻译</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">双语医学协调员、医学术语精准翻译、病历报告翻译</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-heart \"><path d=\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">陪诊与医疗协调</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">挂号与科室对接、全面陪诊服务</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-award \"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle><path d=\"M15.477 12.89 17 22l-5-3-5 3 1.523-9.11\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">涉外医疗文件协助</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">英文医疗邀请函/诊断证明、费用预估函、出院小结</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"pricing\" class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-slate-50\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">参考治疗费用</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">透明定价，全球价格竞争力无与伦比</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-lg border-2 border-emerald-500\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">MFAT全疗程参考费用（含检查等）</h3><div class=\"text-4xl font-bold text-emerald-600 mb-2\">$12,000-20,000</div><p class=\"text-gray-500 mb-4\">根据患者具体情况而定</p><ul class=\"space-y-3 text-gray-600\"><li class=\"flex items-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-emerald-500 mr-2\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>微创脂肪采集</li><li class=\"flex items-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-emerald-500 mr-2\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>MFAT制备与注射</li><li class=\"flex items-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\